  "summary": "On 30 June 1908, at about 7:15 am local time, an object exploded in the air over remote Siberia near the Podkamennaya Tunguska River. NASA describes an asteroid that burst in the atmosphere, leaving an 830-square-mile area of destruction and very few human casualties; no impact crater has been found.",
